    {
      "heading": "To West Tech Energy",
      "paragraphs": [
        "QA/QC is my top priority on this project. The list below is every QA/QC deliverable MPLX needs from West Tech, taken from MPLX SOW Rev 3 (Quality Control, Testing and Turnover; Close Out Documentation) and our 11/20 coordination meeting. These records are what we need for PSSR, commissioning, FCO closeout and final payment, so please start on them now rather than at the end of the job.",
        "Please assign an owner to each item, fill in the date you submit it, and send me an updated copy each Monday before our meeting. I will review status every week and carry it in my daily and weekly reports."
      ],
      "bullets": [
        "Send submittals to me (Davy Francis) by email, with Joel Schweers copied, using both of his addresses.",
        "Items marked \"Before\" a task must be accepted before that task starts (for example, WPS/PQR before further welding; hydrotest packages 24 hours before each test; pre-pour inspection before each pour).",
        "Use the daily weld log template provided, one row per weld, submitted at the end of each work day with RT reader sheets.",
        "Raise any question about a requirement by RFI before the work, not after."
      ]
    },
